  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The total current supplied to the circuit as shown in figure by the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> battery is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\qt0155_5e2c899c4fd3.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 141px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0155_cbbb798642f3.png\" style=\"width: 190px; height: 156px;\" /></p><p>As in this&nbsp;case,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;are&nbsp;in parallel hence, their combined resistance value will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#937;</mi></math>. Now, this&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;with existing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;are in series and hence can be combined to write&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#937;</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0155_1886e015ac3a.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 151px;\" /></p><p>In the final diagram, we can write equivalent resistance across the battery as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#937;</mi></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0155_a823ed2f52f2.png\" style=\"width: 210px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p>Hence, current through the battery is,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#937;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p>"
  }
}